{% comment %}
  Renders one testimonial card in the reviews rail
  (sections/reviews-rail.liquid), driven by a `review` metaobject — see
  METAFIELDS.md for its field definitions.

  Styling lives in assets/section-reviews-rail.css, loaded by that section.

  The prototype rendered ratings as five literal "★" characters with no
  accessible name — a screen reader announces the raw glyphs, not a
  rating. This snippet keeps the visual stars (aria-hidden) and adds a
  real "Rated N out of 5" accessible label instead, using Dawn's own
  `visually-hidden` utility class rather than inventing a duplicate.

  Accepts:
  - review: {Object} a `review` metaobject (required)
  - aria_hidden: {Boolean} true marks the whole card aria-hidden — used
    for the marquee's duplicated second pass so screen readers don't
    announce every review twice (see sections/reviews-rail.liquid)
  - block_attributes: {String} raw `block.shopify_attributes` output to
    inject on the <article> so the theme editor can select/highlight this
    instance — only pass this for the real (non-duplicated) pass

  Note: no per-card reveal-on-scroll delay setting here — the prototype
  fades in the whole rail as one unit (`.revrail.rv`), not each card
  individually, and this snippet matches that.

  Usage:
  {% render 'purelane-card-review', review: block.settings.review, block_attributes: block.shopify_attributes %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign rating = review.rating.value | default: 5
-%}
<article class="pl-glass-2 pl-rcard"{% if block_attributes %} {{ block_attributes }}{% endif %}{% if aria_hidden %} aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
  <div class="pl-rcard__stars" {% if aria_hidden %}aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
    <span aria-hidden="true">
      {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
        {%- if i <= rating -%}&#9733;{%- else -%}&#9734;{%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </span>
    {%- unless aria_hidden -%}
      <span class="visually-hidden">Rated {{ rating }} out of 5</span>
    {%- endunless -%}
  </div>
  <h3>{{ review.title.value }}</h3>
  <p>{{ review.quote.value }}</p>
  <div class="pl-rcard__who">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg>
    <b>{{ review.reviewer_name.value }}</b>
    {%- if review.product_purchased.value != blank -%}
      <span>&middot; {{ review.product_purchased.value }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</article>
